Z||000010||dogtired||01-14-2000||01:28 PM||||The only Old bags I know of that are short are,  -  -  -  -   Opps, wrong FORUM again  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> <P>fierodave, thanks for posting the photos, the last 85 I purchased had the RPO code for the bag? But guess what? None to be found  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Actually the reason for the short bag is due to shrinkage from the sun. I understand there is a reproduction bag out there that was designed right off the deminisions of a shrunk bag. Therefore it is very accurate  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Someday maybe I will find a real one, but not today for the price they are selling for, that is a lot of beer money  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
